new='<section id="page-dashboard" class="page active"><div class="head"><h1>Your AI production universe</h1><p>Chat, create, automate and grow from one intelligent workspace.</p></div><div class="card hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="chip good">NEURAL STUDIO ONLINE</span><h2>From one idea to a complete production.</h2><p>Talk to the AI, generate media, build videos and run your YouTube channel with approval-first automation.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn" data-go="chat">Start AI Chat →</button><button class="btn secondary" data-go="agents">Run Auto Pilot</button></div></div><div class="neural-orb" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb-core"></div><div class="orb-ring"></div><div class="orb-ring r2"></div><div class="orb-node"></div></div></div>'
