chat='''\n    <section id="page-chat" class="page"><div class="card chat-shell"><div class="chat-head"><div><h2>Neural Chat</h2><div class="chat-status"><span class="dot ok"></span> Connected to your AI model router</div></div><div class="row"><select id="chatModel" class="select model-pill"><option value="">Best available model</option></select><button class="btn secondary" id="clearChat">Clear</button></div></div><div id="chatMessages" class="chat-messages"><div id="chatWelcome" class="chat-welcome"><div class="ai-glyph">◈</div><h1>How can I help you create?</h1><p>Ask questions, develop ideas, write content or plan your entire production.</p><div class="suggestions"><button class="suggestion">Plan a YouTube video that can get high retention</button><button class="suggestion">Create a cinematic video concept for my product</button><button class="suggestion">Write 5 strong hooks for my next video</button><button class="suggestion">Build a 30-day content strategy</button></div></div></div><form id="chatForm" class="chat-compose"><div class="compose-row"><textarea id="chatInput" class="textarea chat-input" rows="1" placeholder="Message BG LABS AI…" required></textarea><button id="chatSend" class="btn send-btn" aria-label="Send">↑</button></div><small style="color:var(--muted)">Enter to send · Shift + Enter for a new line</small></form></div></section>\n'''
